# 5. Interview Questions

**Q1. What is correlation?**
Correlation measures the **strength and direction** of the relationship between two variables.

**Q2. What is covariance?**
Covariance measures whether two variables move together in the same or opposite direction.

**Q3. What is the range of correlation?**
**-1 to +1**

**Q4. Which is easier to interpret?**
**Correlation**, because it has a fixed range.

**Q5. Does correlation imply causation?**
**No.** Correlation shows association, not cause and effect.

